This comment is incorrect - the transform will already be in the play/reference space. The reference frame is what is set by `XRServer.center_on_hmd()`. So, maybe something like:


```suggestion
		// Relative to the XROrigin3D, so we need to apply the reference frame.
		Transform3D reference_frame = XRServer::get_singleton()->get_reference_frame();
		xf = reference_frame.inverse() * p_transform;
```

